From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 08:27:40 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: allwinner: a733: Add the GPADC and the LRADC

Add the two low-speed ADCs of the A733, disabled.

The GPADC (A733 manual, 18.12) is at 0x02521000, with interrupt 70 of
the interrupt table (12.2.3.1, SPI 38), the bus gate and reset of
GPADC0_BGR and the 24 MHz module clock GPADC0_24M. The thermal sensor
uses the same module clock.

The LRADC (18.13) is at 0x02524000, with interrupt 69 (SPI 37) and the
bus gate and reset of LRADC_BGR. It has no module clock: the manual
names the 32 kHz oscillator of the RTC as its clock source.

The LRADC node has no vref-supply, which its binding requires: the
supply is a property of the board, and a board that enables the node
adds it.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: the GPADC node, enabled by the board, probes,
and every conversion raises its interrupt; the LRADC node stays disabled
on this board.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 .../arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi | 24 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 24 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
index 9a74859f8b97..6a5e8a74d7b0 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
@@ -688,6 +688,20 @@ i2c0: i2c@2510000 {
 			#size-cells = <0>;
 		};
 
+		gpadc: adc@2521000 {
+			compatible = "allwinner,sun60i-a733-gpadc",
+				     "allwinner,sun20i-d1-gpadc";
+			reg = <0x02521000 0x1000>;
+			interrupts = <GIC_SPI 38 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH 0>;
+			clocks = <&ccu CLK_BUS_GPADC0>, <&ccu CLK_GPADC0_24M>;
+			clock-names = "bus", "mod";
+			resets = <&ccu RST_BUS_GPADC0>;
+			#io-channel-cells = <1>;
+			#address-cells = <1>;
+			#size-cells = <0>;
+			status = "disabled";
+		};
+
 		ths: thermal-sensor@2522000 {
 			compatible = "allwinner,sun60i-a733-ths";
 			reg = <0x02522000 0x400>;
@@ -700,6 +714,16 @@ ths: thermal-sensor@2522000 {
 			#thermal-sensor-cells = <1>;
 		};
 
+		lradc: lradc@2524000 {
+			compatible = "allwinner,sun60i-a733-lradc",
+				     "allwinner,sun50i-r329-lradc";
+			reg = <0x02524000 0x1000>;
+			interrupts = <GIC_SPI 37 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH 0>;
+			clocks = <&ccu CLK_BUS_LRADC>;
+			resets = <&ccu RST_BUS_LRADC>;
+			status = "disabled";
+		};
+
 		syscon: syscon@3000000 {
 			compatible = "allwinner,sun60i-a733-system-control";
 			reg = <0x03000000 0x1000>;
